{
 "id": "macd-cross-trend-01",
 "title": {
  "en": "MACD Cross at the Start of a Trend",
  "bn": "Trend-এর শুরুতে MACD cross"
 },
 "symbol": "EURUSD",
 "timeframe": "H4",
 "mode": "synthetic",
 "type": "trade-setup",
 "bias": "bullish",
 "outcome": "win",
 "tags": [
  "macd",
  "crossover",
  "trend"
 ],
 "module": "07-technical-indicators",
 "lessonSlugs": [
  "03-macd"
 ],
 "caption": {
  "en": "After a base, price breaks higher and the MACD line crosses above its signal at bar 44. Stop under the recent swing low, target 2R.",
  "bn": "Base-এর পরে দাম ওপরে ভাঙে এবং 44 নম্বর bar-এ MACD line signal-এর ওপরে cross করে। Stop সাম্প্রতিক swing low-এর নিচে, target 2R।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "MACD confirms momentum turning up. The stop comes from price structure, not from the indicator.",
  "bn": "MACD দেখায় momentum ওপরে ঘুরছে। Stop আসে price structure থেকে, indicator থেকে নয়।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "A MACD cross is useful when price already shows a trend turn",
   "bn": "MACD cross কাজে লাগে যখন দাম নিজেই trend ঘোরার ইঙ্গিত দেয়"
  }
 ],
